// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`CLI help snapshots > compile --help matches snapshot 1`] = `
"Usage: akrctx compile [options] <taskId>

Compile a task capsule into a ready-to-paste agent brief.

Arguments:
  taskId             task id (e.g. TASK-001)

Options:
  --target <target>  target agent (choices: "codex", "claude", "copilot", "pi",
                     "all")
  --dry-run          show planned writes without writing files (default: false)
  --force            update akrctx-owned files when they already exist (default:
                     false)
  --json             emit JSON output (for scripting) (default: false)
  -h, --help         display help for command

Concatenates task.md + context.md + plan.md + acceptance-criteria.md
into a single .md file at .akrctx/tasks/TASK-XXX/exports/<target>.md.
Paste the brief directly into your agent's context, or let the agent read it.
"
`;

